Noir's playback screen and menus are based on "iPod reFresh Three" by Ciprian Dragu,
licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0, and include artwork derived from it (the Lossless badge and the
volume / repeat / shuffle icons in tools/assets/refresh and .rockbox/wps/Noir).

Therefore this theme — skins (.wps, .sbs, .cfg), bitmaps and the scripts that generate them —
is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported licence (CC BY-SA 3.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

You are free to share and adapt it, provided you give appropriate credit (to Noir and to
iPod reFresh Three by Ciprian Dragu) and distribute your contributions under the same licence.

Fonts are NOT covered by this licence and are not included in the repository: they are converted
locally from Apple's SF Mono and SF Pro Rounded system fonts (tools/make_fonts.sh), which Apple
licenses for use on Apple platforms only.
